spice
* SPICE Netlist
C1 Vin 1 C1_value
R1 1 0 R1_value
RY1 1 2 RY_value
RY2 3 4 RY_value
RY3 4 5 RY_value
? Missing component
C2 2 3 C_value
* Operational Amplifiers
* A1: Inverting input at node 2, output at node 3
A1 2 0 3 OPAMP
* A2: Non-inverting input at node 3, output at node 5
A2 3 0 5 OPAMP
Vin Vin 0 DC 0
* End of Netlist
